{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"luxun-e-o042b","title":"陆议至白围遣周峻张梁袭江夏属县","accounts":[{"id":"luxun-e-o042b-account","label":"《陆逊传第十三》正文","text":"陆议至白围遣周峻张梁袭江夏属县","evidence":["luxun-e-o042b-q"]},{"id":"luxun-a-p008-judgment","label":"裴松之论","text":"裴松之批潜袭小县伤无辜之民，并以诸葛亮渭滨军作比较；其报应说保留为评论。","evidence":["luxun-q-p008-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"遣袭","evidence":["luxun-e-o042b-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0030","role":"袭击","evidence":["luxun-e-o042b-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0031","role":"袭击","evidence":["luxun-e-o042b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"襄阳退军时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["luxun-e-o042b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-o042b-q","source_order":[58,200,"O042b"],"order":10346}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0030","name":"周峻（江夏袭军吴将）","evidence":["luxun-q-o042"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"luxun-m-o042-luxun-p0030","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o042"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o042b-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-ba481c724db712a41f53","layer":"original","quote":"军到白围〖9〗，托言住猎，潜遣将军周峻、张梁等击江夏南新市、安陆、石阳〖10〗。石阳市盛，峻等奄至，人皆捐物入城；城门噎不得关〖11〗，敌乃自斫杀己民，然后得阖。斩首获生，凡千余人。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":64,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o042","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-ba481c724db712a41f53","layer":"original","quote":"乃密与瑾立计：令瑾督舟船；逊悉上兵马，以向襄阳城。敌素惮逊，遽还赴城。瑾便引船出；逊徐整部伍〖8〗，张拓声势，步趋船，敌不敢干。军到白围〖9〗，托言住猎，潜遣将军周峻、张梁等击江夏南新市、安陆、石阳〖10〗。石阳市盛，峻等奄至，人皆捐物入城；城门噎不得关〖11〗，敌乃自斫杀己民，然后得阖。斩首获生，凡千余人。﹝一﹞","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-p008-judgment","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-c069217f3fb429186ec7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：逊虑孙权已退，魏得专力于己；既能张拓形势，使敌不敢犯，方舟顺流，无复怵惕矣；何为复潜遣诸将，奄袭小县，致令市人骇奔，自相伤害？俘馘千人，未足损魏，徒使无辜之民横罹荼酷；与诸葛渭滨之师，何其殊哉！用兵之道既违，失律之凶宜应；其祚无三世，及孙而灭：岂此之余殃哉！","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":223,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c38ae168b0182094c3ea","start":0,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
